    "boss_tm_movement": "Canonical 32-byte body and foot step types are preserved field-for-field. task_bos_tm_1 wraps idle phase0..7 and walking phase0..9; func_080B83C4 wraps body angle index0..10. task_bos_tm_body_1 and task_bos_tm_foot_1 explicitly select translated step indices0..15 or0..8. Reaction paths explicitly use step0..2. Foot phase bytes produce height selectors0..4. Body effect choice uses GetRandom()%4. Seven unused complete zero terminator records and four unused halfword suffix values remain separately named neutral scalar objects; no runtime access is claimed. All record/scalar bytes agree across US/JP/EU."
